@startuml
actor Student
boundary "Student Web UI" as UI
control "Authentication Service" as Auth
database "Student Database" as DB
Student -> UI: Enter username and password
UI -> Auth: login(credentials)
Auth -> DB: findUser(username)
DB --> Auth: user record
Auth -> Auth: verifyPassword()
alt credentials valid
  Auth --> UI: authentication token
  UI --> Student: Show dashboard
else credentials invalid
  Auth --> UI: login error
  UI --> Student: Show error message
end
@enduml
